    { t: "mcq", q: "Read this paragraph from a for-and-against essay.\n'Online shopping, on the other hand, has its pitfalls. Admittedly, it saves time and prices are often lower. Nevertheless, the ease of ordering can encourage impulse buys, and delivery charges may cancel out any savings. For these reasons, shoppers are advised to compare prices carefully before they place an order.'\nWhat is the function of 'Admittedly' here?", o: ["To admit that the writer has made a mistake", "To introduce the writer's final conclusion", "To give an example of the point just made", "To accept a point in favour of the other side before arguing against it"], a: 3, k: "writing", x: "Admittedly تقدّم تنازلاً (concession): يعترف الكاتب بميزة للطرف الآخر ثم يردّ عليها بـ Nevertheless." }
